cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JevSpawn in your research, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "JevSpawn: Inference-Only Structured Decisions and Agent Spawning"
authors:
  - family-names: Su
    given-names: Haoyang
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hoyant-Su/JevSpawn"
url: "https://github.com/Hoyant-Su/JevSpawn"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  JevSpawn explores inference-only structured decisions and batched worker
  spawning with frozen language models. It combines shared input prefixes,
  layer-wise cache execution, and direct categorical readout, with measured
  answerability and coding workflows. It is an independent Jev-style project.
keywords:
  - structured inference
  - agent spawning
  - inference-only
  - language models
